# ServiGestWin10 - English (reference language and fallback)
#
# Format: one "key = text" entry per line, UTF-8. Lines starting with # are comments.
# {0}, {1}... are placeholders: keep them all (the order may change to suit the language).
# Escapes: \n new line, \t tab, \s significant space (leading/trailing spaces are trimmed).
# Keys ending in .one / .other are plural forms (.one for 1; in French also for 0).
# "&" marks the keyboard shortcut letter in menus.
